# Security

- Secrets only from env / secret store; fail closed when missing.
- Compare secrets with `hmac.compare_digest`.
- Never `verify=False`, bare `AllowAny` (justify in comment), `eval`/`exec`/`pickle`/`shell=True`.
- Never put tokens in URLs or logs.
- Use `apps.utils.http_client.requests_session` / `internal_api_headers`.
